---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { PIKOS } from '../consts';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Staff software engineer at Solace Health. Product, mostly backend, and the standards a team runs on."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a staff software engineer at Solace Health, mostly on the backend. I
      joined as engineer fifteen and have helped the engineering team grow more
      than sixfold since.
    </p>
    <p>
      The problems I like best are the ones a team has learned to live with: a
      dashboard nobody trusts, a default that quietly drives most of the server
      traffic, a bug that keeps coming back. I find the cause, fix it, and make
      it hard to reintroduce with a lint rule, a CI check, or a written
      standard.
    </p>
    <p>
      A lot of what I've built that lasts is process. I wrote how engineers at
      Solace propose and decide technical changes, and every engineer uses it. I
      wrote the backend guide the team works from. I've mentored engineers to
      where they don't need me, which is the goal.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside work I'm building <a href={PIKOS.site}>Pikos</a>, a local-first
      notes, tasks and calendar app. Before software I was a biologist and a
      yoga instructor. I live in Seattle with a dachshund, the best kind of dog.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you're working on something and want a hand thinking it through, I'm
      easy to reach.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.125rem;
  }
</style>
